- *   TEETH -> DabyWSClientConfig.eyeColorR/G/B (the emissive model layers)
- *   AURA  -> shader side, from the phase; also used by our own glow emitters
+ * This file said all of that in its header and then did the opposite in its tables.
+ * {@code PHASE_TRACK} -- the teeth -- carried pink/purple at intensity 4.2-5.5, and
+ * {@code AURA_TRACK} carried blue almost everywhere including phase 7, where the
+ * shader paints toxic green. Comparing the two implementations phase by phase, they
+ * disagreed on <b>every single row</b>:
